    "title": "Cloudy and dreary through Friday morning, as the ridge finally weakens - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Angela Schilling ,\n9 hours ago While it is cloudy Wednesday morning, the clouds are only a tease. It looks worse than it actually is. There is a good amount of moisture in the upper levels, but we are missing the energy or lift to really get any showers going. You can see the clouds on our infrared satellite image. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
